Aspartame downstream delta for sugar-toolkit-gtk4, rebased onto main at
9d86a31862f6d676840ed755f109d4cd5bc7c2c6 (2026-10-22; PR #35 is merged).

Conflict decisions taken during the rebase:
- activity.py: keep set_visible(False) in _complete_close; upstream's
  self.close() re-enters Activity.close() and its save path.
- activityfactory.py: keep the Casilda-bound launch surface the shell uses.
  Converging with upstream's full factory port is open follow-up work.
- palettewindow.py: take upstream's rewrite whole, adding only the
  sugar-palette CSS hook. palettemenu.py: take upstream's item-activated
  mapping, keeping our CSS classes and margins.
- icon.py: take upstream's CellRendererIcon GObject properties (they replace
  our props shim); keep our aspect-preserving SVG scaling.
- style.py: take upstream's scoped apply_css_to_widget (drops folded 0026).
- profile.py: keep our key-blob-only public key parsing (presence identity).
Regenerate with scripts/sugar-gtk4-rebase.sh; never hand-edit hunks.
